  "equation": "\u4ee4 p_j(x)=softmax_j(\u2212||x\u2212c_j||\u00b2/temperature)\uff0c\u4ee4 p=p(source)\u3001q=p(target)\uff0c\u4ee4 A_ij=softplus((margin\u2212(c_j\u2212c_i)\u00b7(target\u2212source)/(||target\u2212source||\u2082+eps))/temperature)\u3002L=weight\u00b7mean_mask[\u03a3_ij p_i q_j A_ij + separation_weight\u00b7\u03a3_ij p_i q_j softplus((min_separation\u2212||c_i\u2212c_j||\u2082)/temperature)]\u3002",
